            title: 'ABYSSINIA',
            subtitle: 'Market-Driven High-Low Poker',
            tagline: 'In this market, victory is bought, not dealt.',
          },
          shortDescription: 'A professional 5-card stud variant where players buy their ranks from a fixed-cost market, followed by high-low splits.',
          uiThemes: [
